sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant API as Go API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Worker
    participant EE as Earth Engine

    U->>API: Rainfall-adjusted productivity, 2019–2025
    API->>DB: create analysis + its child series<br/>(s2-phenology per season, chirps-rain-season per season)
    loop each child window
        DB-->>W: job
        W->>EE: compute (interactive, or batch if large)
        W->>DB: outputs + seal snapshot
    end
    Note over DB: last child sealed → analysis job becomes due
    DB-->>W: analysis job
    W->>DB: read sealed child outputs (no Earth Engine)
    W->>W: fit NDVI integral ~ rainfall, residuals, trend
    W->>DB: outputs + seal analysis (hash over child hashes)
    API-->>U: residual per season, degradation trend, caveats
